Output "demos/split/takes/v1-split-take.mp4"
Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 31
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set Padding 8
Set Framerate 30
Hide
Type "bursar"
Enter
Wait+Screen@90s /I am ready\./
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "split this with Maya and ask her for her half on Solana demos/split/receipt-caffe.png"
Enter
Wait+Screen@180s /pay 2\.50 USDC to BHQB/
Wait+Screen@90s /Maya owes/
Sleep 4s
